    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkarruoisho oo Siraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi nanu, amu atotiwuo anaa enkata naiturrurri ilng'anayio le nkata e nkirowuaj anaa enkata naisampuni isabibu, eitu eleku toki naidimi aainosa meetae nkimarrimarrat oo lng'abolo le nkiterata ooshipakino oltau lai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eidaayie oltung'ani le Nkai te nkop, nemeetae oltung'ani supat too ltung'ana eirragita pooki aanyu embukoroto o sarge, nerresh ake pooki tung'ani olalashe to rreshet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii nkaik enye shumata entorroni, pee eas te nkarriyiano, eikilikuanu olkitok o ladung'oni le nkiguana eropare, ore oltung'ani kitok neimaiki ntorrok naang'uar oltau lenye; nena ninche eas tenebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo supat aisul te ninche netiu anaa enkaitubului, ore ilo lenye oji olasipani netiu anaa olpaashe loo lkiku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etabawua enkata oo larripok lenye le nkitamioto enye. Etataana taata olmilo lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mipik osiligi lino ole latia, niming'arakino olchore; torripo enkutuk ino teina nikilej etii olgoo lino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.35+MAT.10.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.35-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.53"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 12.53",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " amu keitaas olayioni menye mbaa e sulare, nedumakino entito ng'otonye, nedumakino entito nayamaki enkaputani; ore ilmang'ati lo ltung'ani naa lelo le nkaji enye makewan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore nanu, kaing'or Olaitoriani naanyu nanu Enkai e njeunoto ai; kaaning nanu Enkai ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keyau Olaitoriani enjeunoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikishipakino nanu, lo mang'atinta lai; tenabatata nanu naa kadumunye; tenaton nanu te naimin, neaku Olaitoriani ewang'an te nkaraki nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kang'iri nanu engoro o Laitoriani, amu ataasa nanu eng'oki tialo ninye, ometaba anaa naamitu ninye, naadung'oki ninye nanu enkiguana. Kaayau ninye nanu enetii ewang'an naa kaing'or nanu enkordunoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedol taa olmang'atinta lai, neiput enkurruna teina naatiaaka nanu, “Koree Olaitoriani Enkai ino?” Neing'or nkonyek aainei ninye; naa kepuoi aaitunyoki ninye enkop, anaa esarng'ab e nkoitoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkolong nashetieki isunta inono! Ore teina olong naa kepuoi aaitalala ilpolosien aaponaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teina olong naa kepuonu enitii eing'uaa Asiria o metabaiki Misiri, o ebaiki enaiposha ometabaiki enaiposha, o ebaiki oldoinyo ometabaiki oldoinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake keaku enkop mijooni te lelo oo manya, te nkaraki ilng'anayio loo nkiaasin enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olng'ur lo Laitoriani te Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taramata iltung'ana linono te ng'udi ino, ina luaata e njung'ore ino. Oobik maate tiatua entim, te mpolos e nkurma eina kop. Nchoo ninche edaa te Bashan o te Gilead, anaa apa too nkolong'i e apa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaa apa too napa olong'i nitupukunye te Misiri, kaitodol nanu ninche mbaa e nking'asia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedol iloshon nekurru te nkidimata enye pooki; neibung ninche nkutukie enye too nkaik, neming'anu nkiyiaa enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemej ninche enterit anaa olasurai, anaa nkeenta e nkop; nepuonu ninche eikirikira eing'uaa isempewueti lenye; neibelekenyakino ninche to lkirutoto Olaitoriani Enkai ang, neureishoyu ninche te nkaraki iyie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaa Ai natiu anaa iyie, apalaki ntorrok, negiroo nkitarruorrot te nkaraki olpisiai le njung'ore enye? Meibung ninye engoro enye ntarasi amu keshipakino ninye enyorrata nauno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keig'il ninye atum olng'ur te nkaraki iyiook, neitunyoo ninye ntorrok ang too nkejek enyena. Inturraa iyie ing'ok ang, anang'aki enguton e naiposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intodolu iyie esupatisho o enkisiligata te Yakobo, nintodolu enyorrata nauno te Abraham anaa apa eninosa olmumai too loo papa ebaiki nkolong'i e moitie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
